    "data": [
        {
            "title": "比特幣在82,000美元上方交易，油價上漲與聯準會前景施壓",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"比特幣反彈至近79,000美元，美國通脹數據符合預期\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5a45012ccb22ac69a8be58f4c1d8338e9942638c96662773ce1d2c48f5603142/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEDAC13D_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">比特幣反彈至近79,000美元，美國通脹數據符合預期</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 比特幣在週末前夕持續承壓，週五交易價格約為82,450美元。油價上漲、美國貨幣政策趨緊的預期，以及加密貨幣安全疑慮的再度升溫，共同壓抑了投資者情緒。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間週六凌晨00:04（北京時間週六12:04），比特幣報82,674.5美元，過去24小時上漲0.53%，但較日內高點下跌約1%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這一全球最大加密貨幣本週累計跌幅接近3%。上週日曾一度逼近87,000美元，此後整週持續走低。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-e8209ec2-85a7-3cfb-9267-b44bc2cea4d5-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">能源價格上漲與利率走高對加密貨幣市場形成壓力，投資者在關鍵通脹數據公布前重新評估美國貨幣政策走向。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">定於下週公布的9月消費者物價指數（CPI）與生產者物價指數（PPI）報告，將進一步揭示聯準會是否可能重啟升息。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">目前市場普遍預期，聯準會將在10月27日至28日的會議上維持基準利率不變，但12月有可能升息25個基點。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">利率走高通常會削弱比特幣等投機性資產的吸引力，因為投資者更傾向於尋求傳統固定收益投資的回報。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">安全疑慮同樣打壓市場情緒。硬體錢包製造商Ledger近日展開調查，起因是有報告指出，透過東南亞某經銷商購買的設備出現加密貨幣失蹤的情況。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">區塊鏈調查人員估計潛在損失介於8,600萬美元至9,340萬美元之間，但Ledger尚未確認相關金額或查明原因。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Ledger已要求經銷商CryptoBilis暫停銷售與出貨，待調查結果出爐。目前尚無確鑿證據顯示Ledger自身系統遭到入侵。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">企業比特幣動態方面，Strategy（NASDAQ:MSTR）旗下的高收益優先股STRC週五攀升至99.71美元，創下6月以來新高。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該優先股年化股息率為12%，Strategy維持美元儲備以支持股息支付。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">若股價突破100美元，公司或可發行更多優先股以融資購入更多比特幣，從而為市場帶來新的企業需求來源。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">其他加密貨幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣</a>過去24小時上漲0.29%，但本週累計跌幅約達7%，表現遜於比特幣，整體加密貨幣市場週五的反彈也難以持續。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣行情：週六早盤山寨幣普遍小幅走高</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據最新市場快照，週六早盤整體加密貨幣價格多數上漲。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球第三大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>上漲1%，報1.4061美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>微漲0.03%，報109.95美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"BNB\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:BNB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/bnb/bnb-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BNB</a>則大漲3.2%，報788.83美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"卡爾達諾（Cardano）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:卡爾達諾（Cardano）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/cardano/ada-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">卡爾達諾（Cardano）</a>急漲7.25%，報0.2516美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣（Dogecoin）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣（Dogecoin）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣（Dogecoin）</a>則上漲1.99%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/maga/trump-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TRUMP</a>當日幾乎持平，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/shiba-inu/shib-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）</a>則上漲2.8%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%AF%94%E7%89%B9%E5%B9%A3%E5%9C%A882-000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E4%B8%8A%E6%96%B9%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93-%E6%B2%B9%E5%83%B9%E4%B8%8A%E6%BC%B2%E8%88%87%E8%81%AF%E6%BA%96%E6%9C%83%E5%89%8D%E6%99%AF%E6%96%BD%E5%A3%93-045957253.html",
